a56451676.1920x1080.jpg?t=1761595430","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3203160/ss_925ba1352540a1c5ed9c25ae2273250a56451676.600x338.jpg?t=1761595430"},{"id":8,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3203160/ss_821875a18a4917ac16be5ab1b701e7010af4c39d.1920x1080.jpg?t=1761595430","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3203160/ss_821875a18a4917ac16be5ab1b701e7010af4c39d.600x338.jpg?t=1761595430"}],"short_description":"Talk your way out of sticky situations. Literally. In this light-hearted adventure, play with your voice to lie, compliment, and coerce your way through everyday conversations. Earn Social Currency, and save your cat. The catch? NPCs are all state-of-the-art AIs who aren't so easily fooled.","steam_appid":3203160,"support_info":{"email":"support@lsb.llc","url":""},"supported_languages":"English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support","type":"game","website":"https://talktomehuman.com/"}